From: clawd20130 <clawd20130@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 18:47:49 +0900
Subject: Android host backend: everything specific to the Android host in
 src/backends/android

kwin_wayland --android-host selects AndroidBackend, the Wayland backend for KWin nested in
the Android host compositor (the APK). Everything only that host needs lives here; upstream
files carry the hooks of the previous patches (docs/72):

- Graphics: the KGSL render device (--android-render-device, default /dev/kgsl-3d0) opened
  without a dmabuf main device; output buffers leased from the host (AndroidGraphicsBuffer-
  Allocator over the lease socket, --android-allocator), UBWC when the modifiers allow it; SHM
  buffers the host maps in /dev/shm (its SELinux label); no implicit synchronization (glFinish
  or the explicit-sync fence); clients get zwp_linux_dmabuf_v1 v3, since they cannot use a
  KGSL main device; client buffers are not scanned out.
- Outputs (AndroidOutput): shown pixel for pixel on a single surface, scale chosen by KWin;
  the phone output offers the Android display's resolutions x refresh rates, is internal and
  has Android's physical size; user changes ask Android to switch (android-display-client.h).
- Host outputs (HostOutput, read from the raw wl_output protocol, as KWayland's Output crashed
  on repeated modes): each cast display the host announces (a Miracast TV, the assistant's
  screen) becomes output CAST-n, fullscreen on it, without a cursor layer, at scale 1.5 until
  the user picks another (kept by name).
- Host text input: text the Android keyboard commits over text-input-v3 goes to KWin's input
  method (HostTextInput).
- Idle inhibition: a zwp_idle_inhibitor_v1 on the phone output while any window inhibits idle;
  the host keeps the screen on (APK 1.46).
- Host restarts: KWin waits up to 60 s for the host's socket, and when the host goes away it
  waits for it and exits with 133 so kwin_wayland_wrapper restarts it without counting a crash.

No environment variable is read; the session passes --android-host (plasma/kwin).

